# The interpreter Dependabot takes for the requirements-*.txt beside this
# file. It reads a .python-version in the directory it scans ahead of the
# root's, and the root's names the newest interpreter the test matrix
# covers, which Dependabot can be yet to support: the Dependency Graph's
# pip job for this directory then fails, and the packages the locks pin go
# without Dependabot alerts.
#
# 3.12 is the interpreter both locks are compiled for (--python-version in
# the header of requirements-hwi.in and requirements-speculos.in) and the
# one integration-hwi.yml installs them with (HWI_PYTHON). Nothing keeps
# the three in step. Dependabot matches the major and minor version alone,
# so no patch is written here.
#
# uv reads this file too, for a command run in this directory, so a
# whole-line comment only, for the reason the root .python-version gives.
3.12
